<title>CANADA: Canadian Gas Assoc storage survey - July 4.</title>
<headline>Canadian Gas Assoc storage survey - July 4.</headline>
<dateline>CALGARY 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canadian Gas Association (CGA) weekly survey of Canadian natural gas in storage in billion cubic feet (bcf) for the week ended July 4:</p>
<p>							 Pct Full  Pct Full</p>
<p>		 07/04/97  06/27/97  Pct Full  Week Ago  Year Ago</p>
<p>East	     79.32     67.78     34.1	29.2	34.1</p>
<p>West	    122.50    109.99     47.7	42.8	51.0</p>
<p>Total Canada  201.81    177.77     41.2	36.3	43.3</p>
<p>East-West division is the Manitoba/Saskatchewan and North Dakota/Minnesota borders.</p>
<p>East capacity 07/04/97: 232.55 bcf, 06/27/97: 232.55 bcf.</p>
</text>
